  "body": "Add the built-in machine file for Haas VF-2SS YT (`508 mm` Y travel).\n\n### Changes\n- Add `assets/machines/haas-vf2ssyt.mch` (`\"model\": \"HAAS VF-2SS YT\"`, `\"vendor\": \"Camcraft\"`, `\"kind\": \"mill\"`, `-762..762 mm` X, `-508..508 mm` Y, `-508..508 mm` Z, `safe_retract: 0.0`, `12000.0` rpm / `22.4` kW rigid-tapping spindle, `M8` flood coolant, `21158.0 mm/min` max feed, `35560.0 mm/min` max rapid, `30` `CAT40` pockets, `CAT40 ER32` default holder, `\"post\": \"Haas\"`).\n- Register `\"Haas VF-2SS YT\"` in `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs` (`MACHINES` and `embedded()`).\n- Add the spec row and `vf2ss_yt_admits_extended_y_moves_that_vf2ss_refuses` in `crates/app/tests/haas_machines.rs`.\n- Add `(\"Haas VF-2SS YT\", Kind::Mill)` in `crates/app/tests/machine.rs`.\n- List `haas-vf2ssyt.mch` in `site/content/guide/check-and-post/posting.md`.\n- Record public Haas sources and choices in `docs/decisions/3682-haas-vf2ss-yt.md`.\n\n### Readings and pinning tests\nAll checks ran on final head `12c4d485ff1b3ae959adb777b326febb8cbd2079` in software and automated tests. No physical mill ran this configuration.\n- Pinning tests:\n  - `vf2ss_yt_admits_extended_y_moves_that_vf2ss_refuses`\n  - `every_haas_machine_lists_validates_and_mounts`\n  - `every_haas_machine_states_its_requested_configuration`\n  - `haas_travel_feed_and_spindle_limits_are_inclusive_and_enforced` (`haas_machines`: 4 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `every_shipped_machine_mounts_and_speaks_its_declaration` (`machine`: 33 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `every_shipped_machine_reads_from_disk` (`shipped_from_disk`: 2 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `shipped_machines_reserve_no_pocket_without_a_cited_manual` (`post::tool_reservations`: 8 passed, 0 failed)\n  - `machines_pane` tests (`14 passed`)\n  - `example_line_endings` (`3 passed`)\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base baad348f1`: 295/295 steps green (`post` + `app`).\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` (from `crates/ui`): 1668 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored.\n- `cargo xtask gate light`: 6/6 steps green (`motion` light lib 7 passed, `adaptive_troch_island` 1 passed, `adaptive_troch_neck` 1 passed, `adaptive_troch_parallel` 1 passed, `app::pocket_pass_start` 1 passed).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-ui -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Heavy lanes: none required (`P6` enhancement; full heavy lanes run on the cut runner).\n\n### Not exercised\n- No physical Haas VF-2SS YT mill or CNC controller ran this file (software and test verification only).\n- UI pixel snapshot goldens (`#[ignore]`) stay on the cut runner.\n- `git merge-tree --write-tree upstream/main 12c4d485f` merges cleanly with zero conflicts.\n\nfork synced at v0.26.0\nChangelog: Added built-in Haas VF-2SS YT machine definition (-508..508 mm Y travel).\nEffort: medium\nFixes #3682\n",
